l with the 10-year-old boy, whose name is Thompson. And they played with pranks and Robbie ate a good dinner and was patient about waiting his turn to get on the back of the electrical bike. And even allowed Daisy to sit on his lap for the ride, but he got very tired and wanted to come home and went to bed earlier than normal. And it''s the beginning of summer.', NULL, '🥱', 'negative', '[]'::jsonb, 6, 1781756264650, 0) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
